            <title>[IGNITE-8707] DataStorageMetrics.getTotalAllocatedSize metric does not account reserved partition page header.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8707</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;DataStorageMetrics.getTotalAllocatedSize should supposedly return size of datastorage on disk.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, naive executing `du -bs` in the work/db shows very different values.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
